Specifications
--------------

ANSI/ASHRAE Standard 135-2024 (BACnet) is a copyrighted ASHRAE standard;
it is not redistributed. The numeric tables this module uses are facts
taken from it and written as Go constants in our own words: object type,
property identifier, service choice, error class and code, reject and
abort reason, BVLC function, network message, BVLC-SC message and option
numbers, the BACnetEventState, BACnetNotifyType, BACnetEventType,
DeviceCommunicationControl and ReinitializeDevice enumerations, and the
hub connector state names. The octet examples of Annex F and AB.2.17 are
used as test vectors (vectors_test.go). No text of the standard is
reproduced; comments cite clause and annex numbers.

