Interop test peer (interop/, not part of the module's packages)
---------------------------------------------------------------

The nested test-only module interop/ builds bacnet-stack 1.6.1
(https://github.com/bacnet-stack/bacnet-stack, Copyright Steve Karg and
contributors, GPL-2.0 with the GCC linking exception) from its sources
in a Docker container on the tester's machine and runs its demo programs
as separate processes. No bacnet-stack source or binary is included in
this repository or linked into this module; the image is not
distributed. The BACnet/SC test issues its certificates from the test CA
that ships with bacnet-stack (bin/certs), read from the container at run
time and not stored here.

Test data
---------

Every certificate, key, address, device instance and point value in the
tests and examples is generated or made up; none belongs to a real
installation.
